    "reviews": "\u201cThere is nothing superfluous. In any case, the game and its simple story will bring you at least a little joy.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201cAmazing. This game is very different from all the games I have played.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201cI like a lot of things in this game. The history, the atmosphere, the music and the clean and minimalist UI.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br>",
